<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch bond market closed for Whit Monday holiday.</title>
<headline>Dutch bond market closed for Whit Monday holiday.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch bond market is closed on Monday for the Whit Monday holiday and will reopen on Tuesday morning.</p>
<p>Bonds closed sharply lower on Friday ahead of the holiday, taking a technical nosedive behind Bund futures.</p>
<p>The 5.75 percent February 2007 bond ended down 0.43 points at 100.52/60 for a 5.68 percent bid yield.</p>
<p>----Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 570 8500</p>
